ad\">板・売買フローの推定（AI）</div><div class=\"discnote\">この銘柄は本日の分析対象外です（今夜の厳選・出尽くしサイン・レーティング変化・注目開示などの注目銘柄のみ、毎晩の実行で場中の5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(22年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"60.8\" width=\"320\" height=\"7.299999999999997\" fill=\"#c62f2f\" opacity=\"0.12\"/><polyline points=\"4.0,71.5 9.1,66.2 14.2,62.3 19.3,69.1 24.5,88.5 29.6,85.6 34.7,91.9 39.8,94.3 44.9,92.4 50.0,94.8 55.1,97.2 60.3,94.3 65.4,94.3 70.5,95.3 75.6,87.0 80.7,90.0 85.8,79.3 91.0,84.1 96.1,81.2 101.2,74.9 106.3,69.6 111.4,69.6 116.5,71.5 121.6,54.5 126.8,42.9 131.9,39.9 137.0,53.1 142.1,56.0 147.2,37.0 152.3,43.8 157.4,34.6 162.6,18.1 167.7,12.8 172.8,36.5 177.9,30.7 183.0,28.3 188.1,36.1 193.2,32.7 198.4,31.7 203.5,38.5 208.6,51.6 213.7,43.8 218.8,56.9 223.9,56.9 229.0,56.0 234.2,56.0 239.3,60.3 244.4,64.2 249.5,75.4 254.6,63.7 259.7,58.4 264.9,49.7 270.0,50.6 275.1,53.5 280.2,47.7 285.3,38.0 290.4,34.6 295.5,34.6 300.7,46.7 305.8,44.8 310.9,49.7 316.0,49.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 83.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 83.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 83.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 4.0 83.5 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 142.1 68.0 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><path d=\"M 208.6 63.6 l 5 8 l -10 0 z\" fill=\"#c62f2f\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"49.2\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e